// An array as a value, class methods: cm kept arg. KIELER rejects it: passing argument 2 of ‘Main_K_g’ makes integer
// from pointer without a cast [-Wint-conversion].
scchart Main { int a[2] class K { int p int q[2] int g(int n) { int s = 0 for (int j = 0; j < 2; j++) { s += n } return s } } k output int x initial state A do x = k.g(a) go to A }
